Package: fhirviews
Type: Package
Title: Query 'HL7 FHIR' Servers and Flatten Resources with 'SQL on FHIR'
    View Definitions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ronald Fabricio", "Salas Guerrero",
           email = "fabriciosalasguerrero@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A client for 'HL7 FHIR' R4 servers (search with automatic
    paging, read, create, update, delete and the '$everything' and
    '$validate' operations) and an engine that turns FHIR resources into
    tables following the 'SQL on FHIR' 'ViewDefinition' specification
    <https://sql-on-fhir.org/>. 'FHIRPath' expressions are evaluated with
    the 'fhirpath.js' library through the 'V8' package. Includes the official
    'SQL on FHIR' conformance test suite, optional export of views to
    'DuckDB', and integration with the 'RStudio' Connections pane and
    addins. Documentation is in Spanish.
